body:
Inconsistent use of `.describe()` calls. Properties like `expiration`, `multipartThreshold` have descriptions, but others like `name`, `region`, `public`, `versioning`, `provider`, `accessKeyId`, `secretAccessKey`, `endpoint` do not. All properties should have descriptive `.describe()` calls for consistency with established codebase patterns.
```suggestion
  name: z.string().describe('Bucket machine name (snake_case identifier used in configs)'),
  region: z.string().optional().describe('Cloud region or location for the bucket'),
  public: z.boolean().default(false).describe('Whether objects in this bucket are publicly readable by default'),
  versioning: z.boolean().default(false).describe('Enable object versioning for this bucket'),
  encryption: z.enum(['none', 'aes256', 'kms']).default('none').describe('Server-side encryption strategy for objects in this bucket'),
  lifecycle: z.object({
    expirationDays: z.number().optional().describe('Number of days before objects are permanently deleted'),
    transitionToArchive: z.number().optional().describe('Number of days before objects transition to colder/archive storage'),
  }).optional().describe('Lifecycle rules controlling retention and archival behavior'),
});

export const PresignedUrlConfigSchema = z.object({
  expiration: z.number().default(3600).describe('Expiration in seconds'),
  allowedOperations: z.array(z.enum(['get', 'put', 'delete'])).describe('List of HTTP/object operations allowed for the presigned URL'),
});

export const ObjectStorageConfigSchema = z.object({
  provider: StorageProviderSchema.describe('Object storage provider implementation to use'),
  accessKeyId: z.string().optional().describe('Access key or client ID used to authenticate with the storage provider'),
  secretAccessKey: z.string().optional().describe('Secret key or client secret used to authenticate with the storage provider'),
  endpoint: z.string().optional().describe('Custom endpoint URL for the storage provider (useful for MinIO/local stacks)'),
  buckets: z.array(BucketConfigSchema).describe('List of bucket configurations managed by this storage provider'),
  multipartThreshold: z.number().default(5242880).describe('Minimum object size in bytes before multipart upload is used (5MB default)'),
  presignedUrls: PresignedUrlConfigSchema.optional().describe('Defaults for presigned URL generation'),
```
